            "review_title": "Review at SH Garden",
            "review_text": "Nicole J\nFrance27 contributions\n0\nWhat a disappointment!\nMar 2026 • Friends\nIf the nems are very good, the rest of the dishes (4 different courses) are very average. The one with clams is reduced in quantity, which forces to recommend rice. It is also very spicy like the other two different dishes. As for the note, it was very salty. \nVery slow and offbeat service. None of us could eat at the same time. Recommended by the guide of the Routard this restaurant does not match the promises. Only the setting pleased us. Poor value for money.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten March 31, 2026",
