            "review_text": "Paul K\nGloucestershire, United Kingdom123 contributions\n0\nGreat spot for a drink and dinner\nJan 2020 • Couples\nWe saw the light on the first floor of this restaurant and were tempted. We popped in for a drink but was so impressed with the food choice and stayed for dinner. Ordering was difficulty as it was a very extensive set of IPad Pages and not a paper menu. So after choosing you couldn’t remember which of the numerous pages to go to on the IPad to show the waitress.\n\nHowever we had fresh bamboo shoots with pork, stir fried veg, mushrooms with tofu and sticky rice. All excellent.\nRead more\nWritten January 31, 2020",
