            "review_text": "TheMithfitz\nGeelong, Australia59 contributions\n0\nBeautifully presented food\nDec 2019\nWe were sitting up in the rooftop bar Saigon Saigon, and were looking down at the SH Garden and decided to go there for dinner. We thought we could eat outside by the look of it, but unfortunately we couldn't - maybe it was booked out.\nAnyway, after getting to the 3rd floor in an ancient wooden lift, we were shown to a table. This was our 3rd night in Saigon and previously had only eaten in street food cafes and restaurants, so this was a step up!\nWe weren't disappointed, the food was outstanding, as was the service. Not as cheap as some places, but definitely worth it.\nWe had squid salad which was amazing, and fried frog - also fantastic - among other things. The fruit and veg cut as decorations - flowers, birds, etc - were incredible!\nDefinitely recommend.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 8, 2020",
