            "review_text": "esCape2\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia40 contributions\n0\nGood place to sample classic Vietnamese cuisine\nDec 2019 • Couples\nThe restaurant is located on the roof top with nice colonial ambience, good view and nice interior decor. Classic Vietnamese cuisines were served there but they went one level up with their beautiful plater presentation and generous portion for each dish. Their food quality and prices were slightly above average. One of the waiters attended to us were not so fluent in English thus not so friendly. It is worth a visit if one is not so adventurous and new to Vietnamese cuisine.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 3, 2020",
